\title{Hozo: Estimate Mean and Standard Deviation from Median and Range}
\description{
Many clinical studies report the median and range of an outcome instead of its mean and standard deviation, which makes them hard to pool in a meta-analysis. Implements the estimators of Hozo, Djulbegovic and Hozo (2005) \doi{10.1186/1471-2288-5-13} for the mean, standard deviation and variance of a sample from its median, minimum, maximum and size. For each study, the estimator is chosen by sample size, as the authors recommend. The inputs are vectorised, so one call converts a whole table of studies.
}
